  <div class="titleLinkContainer">
    <a href="#7683806"
       class="titleLink"
    >
    <span class="titleNumber">
      § 255-53
    </span>
    <span class="titleTitle"
          data-guid="7683806"
    >
Promulgation of rules and regulations.    </span>
    </a>
  </div>
      </label>
  </div>
                </header>
        <div class="notes" id="notes-7683806" data-guid="7683806"></div>
        <div id="questions-7683806" data-guid="7683806" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="7683806_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="history">[Amended <span class="legref" data-ref=""><span class="hisdate">12-2-2013</span> by <span class="loclaw">L.L. No. 5-2013</span></span>]</div><div class="para">The Chief may promulgate such rules and regulations as may be necessary to carry out the provisions of this article.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
                <article>
                <header>
  <div data-component="h2"
       class="contentTitle barTitle sectionTitle 7683807"
      id="7683807"
      data-guid="7683807"
      data-position="6185"
      data-full-title="§ 255-54: Administrative liability."
      data-code-content-type="section"
  >
    <span class="selectionBox material-icons material-symbols-outlined material-symbols-and-filled md-24"
         title="Select this content"
         aria-label="Select this content"
    >
      <input type="checkbox" class="selectionBoxInput" id="7683807_input"/>
    </span>
    <label class="selectionLabel" id="7683807_label" for="7683807_input">
  <div class="titleLinkContainer">
    <a href="#7683807"
       class="titleLink"
    >
    <span class="titleNumber">
      § 255-54
    </span>
    <span class="titleTitle"
          data-guid="7683807"
    >
Administrative liability.    </span>
    </a>
  </div>
      </label>
  </div>
                </header>
        <div class="notes" id="notes-7683807" data-guid="7683807"></div>
        <div id="questions-7683807" data-guid="7683807" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="7683807_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">Neither the City of Albany, nor any officer, agent or employee thereof, shall be personally liable for any damage resulting from any official determination, order or action required or permitted by or under this article.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
                <article>
                <header>
  <div data-component="h2"
       class="contentTitle barTitle sectionTitle 7683808"
