        <div class="notes" id="notes-7683808" data-guid="7683808"></div>
        <div id="questions-7683808" data-guid="7683808" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="7683808_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">For the purposes of this article, references to the <a class="statref" href="https://municipal.codes/NY/PEN/" target="_blank">Penal Law</a>, Alcoholic Beverage and Control Law, <a class="statref" href="https://municipal.codes/NY/VAT/" target="_blank">Vehicle and Traffic Law</a>, Tax Law and <a class="statref" href="https://municipal.codes/NY/SOS/" target="_blank">Social Services Law</a> shall mean the laws of the State of New York.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
                <article>
                <header>
  <div data-component="h2"
       class="contentTitle barTitle sectionTitle 7683809"
