<div class="section_content content" id="7683809_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">If any provision of this article or the application thereof to any person or circumstance is held invalid, the remainder of this article and the application of such provision to other persons or circumstances shall not be rendered invalid thereby.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
